>I saw someone post about going through a lot of effort to create
>Lemba wafers.  Why?  What are they good for except for food?

Lembas wafers have the same food value as food rations, but they weigh
4 times less.  So, if you had 20 food rations (which you couldn't 
carry with you anyways), you could polymorph them into lembas wafers
and then you probably could.  If they happen to turn into tins of
spinach, or tins of wraith meat, so much the better.
